## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: |cffC9A24ATwich|rUI
## Notes: A carefully crafted UI enhancement addon for WoW Forever that makes the game interface feel a little cleaner, more cohesive, and more considered, without making it feel modernized beyond recognition.
## Author: twichie
## Version: 1.0.0
## SavedVariables: TwichUIDB, TwichUIBackupDB, TwichUIShareDB, TwichUIRestoreDB, TwichUIChronicleDB
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\!!!TwichUI\media\icon
## AddonCompartmentFunc: TwichUI_OnCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: TwichUI_OnCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: TwichUI_OnCompartmentLeave
## X-License: MIT (code); SIL OFL 1.1 (fonts); see LICENSE and licenses/
## Category: Interface Enhancements
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1719280

